iew-description":"After the ferry crossing, the group makes several stops along Dordrecht's riverside, passing barges and cranes on a working quay, with the traveler and his companion posing at docks along the way before the full cycling tour group gathers for photos together, waving and flashing peace signs with the river and countryside behind them.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-06/20260706_145643.jpg","photos/2026-07-06/20260706_145708.jpg","photos/2026-07-06/20260706_145712.jpg","photos/2026-07-06/20260706_145737.jpg","photos/2026-07-06/20260706_145739.jpg","photos/2026-07-06/20260706_145740.jpg","photos/2026-07-06/20260706_145801.jpg","photos/2026-07-06/20260706_145834.jpg","photos/2026-07-06/20260706_145848.jpg","photos/2026-07-06/20260706_145926.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-06","cluster_idx":6,"centroid_lat":51.816992,"centroid_lon":4.679839,"time_start":"2026-07-06T15:56:02.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-06T22:17:29.000Z","location_label":"Lange Wantijkade, Dordrecht","place_full":"83, Lange Wantijkade, Stadswerven, Dordrecht, Zuid-Holland, Nederland, 3311 MC, Nederland","country":"Nederland","overview-description":"Winding down after the day's ride in Dordrecht, feet up on the windowsill overlooking the modern waterfront, before heading out to a riverside deck for Belgian beers as the striking V-shaped bascule bridge glows orange over the water at sunset, with houseboats and a paddle steamer visible across the river.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-06/20260706_155602-EDIT.jpg","photos/2026-07-06/20260706_155602.jpg","photos/2026-07-06/20260706_175620.jpg","photos/2026-07-06/20260706_175942.jpg","photos/2026-07-06/20260706_180004.jpg","photos/2026-07-06/20260706_180012.jpg","photos/2026-07-06/20260706_180428.jpg","photos/2026-07-06/20260706_180832.jpg","photos/2026-07-06/20260706_221729.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-07","cluster_idx":0,"centroid_lat":51.531528,"centroid_lon":4.21977,"time_start":"2026-07-07T10:45:31.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-07T11:06:32.000Z","location_label":"Oudelandsestraat, Tholen","place_full":"2, Oudelandsestraat, Tholen, Zeeland, Nederland, 4691 BK, Nederland","country":"Nederland","overview-description":"Exploring Willemstad's fortified old town along its heritage trail, from numbered pavement plaques with QR codes to the brick church, a 17th-century stepped-gable market building, and a whimsical giant clog planter overflowing with pink impatiens.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-07/20260707_104531.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_104632.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_104643.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_105127.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_110632.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-07","cluster_idx":1,"centroid_lat":51.531265,"centroid_lon":4.221171,"time_start":"2026-07-07T10:57:24.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-07T10:58:55.000Z","location_label":"Markt, Tholen","place_full":"19, Markt, Tholen, Zeeland, Nederland, 4691 BX, Nederland","country":"Nederland","overview-description":"Wandering Willemstad's quiet streets past its church towers before climbing the star-shaped fortress ramparts, where the couple poses in front of the historic windmill De Verwachting, dated 1848, with the moat visible below.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-07/20260707_105724.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_105838.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_105855.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-07","cluster_idx":2,"centroid_lat":51.530424,"centroid_lon":4.219454,"time_start":"2026-07-07T11:04:28.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-07T11:04:39.000Z","location_label":"Vlasmarkt, Tholen","place_full":"2, Vlasmarkt, Tholen, Zeeland, Nederland, 4691 BH, Nederland","country":"Nederland","overview-description":"A burst of nearly identical frames of the couple posing together in front of the De Verwachting windmill on Willemstad's fortress ramparts.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-07/20260707_110428.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_110432.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_110436.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_110439.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-07","cluster_idx":3,"centroid_lat":51.529323,"centroid_lon":4.3012,"time_start":"2026-07-07T11:58:05.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-07T12:04:13.000Z","location_label":"Schansbaan, Bergen op Zoom","place_full":"Schansbaan, Halsteren, Bergen op Zoom, Noord-Brabant, Nederland, 4661 PM, Nederland","country":"Nederland","overview-description":"A walk along Willemstad's star-shaped fortress ramparts, past old cannons and a wooden lookout tower offering sweeping views over the moat, windmill, and surrounding countryside, following the grassy earthworks around the town's historic defenses.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-07/20260707_115805.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_115837.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_115859.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_115939.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_115944.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_120311.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_120324.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_120405.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_120413.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-07","cluster_idx":4,"centroid_lat":51.502226,"centroid_lon":4.329898,"time_start":"2026-07-07T12:37:00.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-07T12:44:51.000Z","location_label":"Ruytershoveweg, Bergen op Zoom","place_full":"Ruytershoveweg, Bergen op Zoom, Noord-Brabant, Nederland, 4622 RK, Nederland","country":"Nederland","overview-description":"A somber visit to the Canadian War Cemetery in Bergen-op-Zoom, walking among the neat rows of headstones marking soldiers who died in 1944 during the liberation of the Netherlands, with the central memorial, entrance pavilion, and quiet landscaped grounds serving as a lasting tribute.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-07/20260707_123700.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_123824.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_123913.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_123936.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_124153.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_124250.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_124350.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_124451.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-07","cluster_idx":5,"centroid_lat":51.22787,"centroid_lon":4.404813,"time_start":"2026-07-07T18:46:46.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-07T22:15:19.000Z","location_label":"Hanzestedenplaats, Antwerpen","place_full":"Hanzestedenplaats, Nieuwstad-Cadix, Eilandje, Antwerpen, Vlaanderen, 2000, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"An evening wander through Antwerp mixing street-level charm with a bit of whimsy — a corner shrine statue and dinner ice cream giving way to a striking rooftop art installation of ghostly white figures scrambling across a historic slate roof at dusk.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-07/20260707_184646.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_215450.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_221510.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_221519.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-07","cluster_idx":6,"centroid_lat":51.222548,"centroid_lon":4.404164,"time_start":"2026-07-07T18:55:14.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-07T18:55:14.000Z","location_label":"Pottenbrug, Antwerpen","place_full":"Pottenbrug, Historisch Centrum, Antwerpen, Vlaanderen, 2000, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"Antwerp's Renaissance-era Stadhuis on the Grote Markt, its facade strung with a long row of international flags catching the evening light.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-07/20260707_185514.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-07","cluster_idx":7,"centroid_lat":51.22115,"centroid_lon":4.399609,"time_start":"2026-07-07T19:00:55.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-07T21:26:41.000Z","location_label":"Grote Markt, Antwerpen","place_full":"Grote Markt, Historisch Centrum, Antwerpen, Vlaanderen, 2000, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"A sweeping evening tour of Antwerp's Grote Markt and riverside, from the mythic Brabo Fountain and gold-trimmed guild houses to the glowing cathedral spire, capped by playful group photos beneath the sleeping-giant sculpture and the hands-on-hips Arbeid Vrijheid statue before heading down to the Scheldt to see 't Steen fortress and the MAS museum tower at sunset.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-07/20260707_190055.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_190159.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_190206.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_190222.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_190247.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_190300.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_191211.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_192512.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_192522.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_210505.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_210823.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_210826.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_210831.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_211239.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_211240.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_211243.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_212507.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_212633.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_212639.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_212641.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-07","cluster_idx":8,"centroid_lat":51.222111,"centroid_lon":4.39788,"time_start":"2026-07-07T21:30:33.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-07T21:32:59.000Z","location_label":"de Bomma, Antwerpen","place_full":"de Bomma, 3, Willem Ogierplaats, Historisch Centrum, Antwerpen, Vlaanderen, 2000, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"Sunset views along Antwerp's riverside, with 't Steen castle and the Lange Wapper statue glowing gold, paired with close-up details of a weathered bronze bust and heraldic carving and a low-angle shot of a Gothic church's twin spires.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-07/20260707_213033.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_213120.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_213127.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_213259.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-07","cluster_idx":9,"centroid_lat":51.228061,"centroid_lon":4.402494,"time_start":"2026-07-07T21:45:18.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-07T21:46:54.000Z","location_label":"Sint-Aldegondiskaai, Antwerpen","place_full":"Sint-Aldegondiskaai, Nieuwstad-Cadix, Eilandje, Antwerpen, Vlaanderen, 2000, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"Dusk settles over Antwerp's harbor, the MAS museum tower and a neighboring red-brick building reflected in the still water beneath a pink sky, with a giant inflatable swim buoy marking the open-water swimming dock.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-07/20260707_214518.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_214523.jpg","photos/2026-07-07/20260707_214655.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-08","cluster_idx":0,"centroid_lat":51.220303,"centroid_lon":4.401404,"time_start":"2026-07-08T10:00:26.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-08T10:49:22.000Z","location_label":"Groenplaats, Antwerpen","place_full":"Kathedraal, 21, Groenplaats, Historisch Centrum, Antwerpen, Vlaanderen, 2000, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"A deep dive into Antwerp Cathedral of Our Lady, from a morning revisit to the sleeping-giant-baby street sculpture to the cathedral's rich interior — stained glass, Rubens-tradition paintings, gilded reliquaries, an ornate Baroque pulpit, and the Assumption altarpiece — plus a detour into the excavated medieval crypt beneath the building and a playful moment trying on a ceremonial robe.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-08/20260708_100027.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_100232.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_100738.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_100956.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_101328.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_101548.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_101650.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_102237.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_102352.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_102456.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_102827.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_103238.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_103611.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_103743.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_103746.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_103943.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_104000.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_104024.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_104041.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_104129.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_104233.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_104419.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_104447.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_104507.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_104559.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_104609.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_104922.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-08","cluster_idx":1,"centroid_lat":51.221692,"centroid_lon":4.395791,"time_start":"2026-07-08T11:25:32.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-08T11:25:32.000Z","location_label":"Steenplein, Antwerpen","place_full":"Steenplein, ponton aan het Steen > Kruibeke & Hemiksem, Historisch Centrum, Antwerpen, Vlaanderen, 2000, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"The cycling tour group boarding the Waterbus ferry between Kruibeke and Hemiksem as the day's route continues out of Antwerp along the Scheldt.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-08/20260708_112532.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-08","cluster_idx":2,"centroid_lat":51.145695,"centroid_lon":4.302588,"time_start":"2026-07-08T12:16:37.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-08T12:21:34.000Z","location_label":"Achter den Berg, Bazel","place_full":"Achter den Berg, Parkwijk, Bazel, Beveren-Kruibeke-Zwijndrecht, Sint-Niklaas, Oost-Vlaanderen, Vlaanderen, 9150, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"A brick moated castle along the countryside cycling route near Antwerp, its turrets reflected in still water shared by a resident grey heron and mallard duck, with a blue suspension footbridge carrying cyclists across the moat.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-08/20260708_121636.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_121739.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_121819.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_122134.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-08","cluster_idx":3,"centroid_lat":51.05589,"centroid_lon":4.200628,"time_start":"2026-07-08T14:26:27.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-08T14:26:43.000Z","location_label":"Kaai, Sint-Amands","place_full":"Kaai, Sint-Amands, Puurs-Sint-Amands, Mechelen, Antwerpen, Vlaanderen, 2890, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"An afternoon stretch of the cycling route along the Scheldt, following a tree-shaded riverside promenade to a small ferry crossing where the boats Reneke and Ronny II wait to shuttle cyclists across the water.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-08/20260708_142626.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_142633.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_142643.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-08","cluster_idx":4,"centroid_lat":51.032215,"centroid_lon":4.102382,"time_start":"2026-07-08T15:35:27.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-08T16:29:13.000Z","location_label":"Kasteelstraat, Dendermonde","place_full":"1-4, Kasteelstraat, Mechelse Poort, Dendermonde, Oost-Vlaanderen, Vlaanderen, 9200, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"A well-earned post-ride break at a sidewalk cafe, the cycling group relaxing over Tripel Karmeliet and other beers with helmets piled on the table, captured both directly and reflected in a window.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-08/20260708_153528.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_162909.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_162912.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_162913.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-08","cluster_idx":5,"centroid_lat":51.031213,"centroid_lon":4.097918,"time_start":"2026-07-08T17:29:35.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-08T17:29:44.000Z","location_label":"Vleeshuismuseum, Dendermonde","place_full":"Vleeshuismuseum, 32, Grote Markt, Gentse Poort, Dendermonde, Oost-Vlaanderen, Vlaanderen, 9200, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"Dendermonde's Belfort tower and town square in the afternoon sun, the cycling group gathered below its gilded clock face and red bell chamber.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-08/20260708_172935.jpg","photos/2026-07-08/20260708_172944.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-09","cluster_idx":0,"centroid_lat":51.028784,"centroid_lon":4.041144,"time_start":"2026-07-09T09:51:50.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-09T09:52:23.000Z","location_label":"Appels, Dendermonde","place_full":"Appels, Hoofdstraat, Appels, Dendermonde, Oost-Vlaanderen, Vlaanderen, 9200, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"The group's river hotel barge, the MS Fluvius, gliding past reed-lined banks with bikes and luggage aboard as passengers wave from the sun deck, captured in a series of shots from the shore.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-09/20260709_095150.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_095208.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_095217.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_095222.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_095223.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-09","cluster_idx":1,"centroid_lat":51.045789,"centroid_lon":3.975722,"time_start":"2026-07-09T10:41:49.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-09T10:42:15.000Z","location_label":"Brielstraat, Berlare","place_full":"'t Weiken, Brielstraat, Overmere, Berlare, Dendermonde, Oost-Vlaanderen, Vlaanderen, 9290, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"A relaxed lakeside cafe break along the cycling route, with drinks and snacks set out beside a lily-pad-covered lake lined with Somersby-branded umbrellas and rows of reserved deckchairs.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-09/20260709_104149.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_104207.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_104215.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-09","cluster_idx":2,"centroid_lat":51.029176,"centroid_lon":3.847297,"time_start":"2026-07-09T11:59:42.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-09T11:59:42.000Z","location_label":"Dorpsstraat, Laarne","place_full":"49, Dorpsstraat, Laarne, Dendermonde, Oost-Vlaanderen, Vlaanderen, 9270, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"A gabled white building along the cycling route, its steep tiled roof rising above a cobblestone street, housing the aptly named White Rabbit Tattoo Studio.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-09/20260709_115942.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-09","cluster_idx":3,"centroid_lat":51.029664,"centroid_lon":3.850431,"time_start":"2026-07-09T12:50:56.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-09T12:52:12.000Z","location_label":"Sint-Machariuskerk, Laarne","place_full":"Sint-Machariuskerk, Dorpsstraat, Laarne, Dendermonde, Oost-Vlaanderen, Vlaanderen, 9270, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"Two contrasting roadside stops — a quiet moment inside a small church with candlelit stained glass, and a playful pose inside the hollow neck of an abstract stone figure sculpture.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-09/20260709_125056.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_125211.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-09","cluster_idx":4,"centroid_lat":51.028138,"centroid_lon":3.839349,"time_start":"2026-07-09T13:02:25.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-09T13:08:54.000Z","location_label":"Eekhoekstraat, Laarne","place_full":"Eekhoekstraat, Laarne, Dendermonde, Oost-Vlaanderen, Vlaanderen, 9270, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"A midday visit to moated Laarne Castle, its turrets and mullioned windows explored from multiple angles around the boxwood garden and glassy moat, before the group parks their bikes in a Ghent garage to begin a walking tour of the city center.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-09/20260709_130225.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_130311.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_130314.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_130604.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_130624.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_130734.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_130854.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-09","cluster_idx":5,"centroid_lat":51.053692,"centroid_lon":3.724854,"time_start":"2026-07-09T14:19:45.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-09T15:05:38.000Z","location_label":"Emile Braunplein, Gent","place_full":"40, Emile Braunplein, Sint-Jacobs, Gent, Oost-Vlaanderen, Vlaanderen, 9000, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"A thorough climb up Ghent's Belfry, from its gilded dragon spire and carillon bells to the mechanical clockworks and medieval knight exhibits, rewarded at the top with sweeping rooftop panoramas over Saint Bavo's Cathedral and the city's canals, before descending past the famous Roland bell back to Sint-Baafsplein.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-09/20260709_141945.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_142314.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_142317.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_142959.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_143109.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_143214.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_143301.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_143400.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_143525.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_143535.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_143547.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_144113.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_144734.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_144749.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_144757.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_144832.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_144838.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_144849.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_144938.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_144944.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_145008.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_145013.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_145034.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_145044.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_145122.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_145218.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_145648.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_150538.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-09","cluster_idx":6,"centroid_lat":51.053812,"centroid_lon":3.722146,"time_start":"2026-07-09T14:45:04.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-09T16:17:22.000Z","location_label":"Korenmarkt, Gent","place_full":"14;14A-14C, Korenmarkt, Patershol, Gent, Oost-Vlaanderen, Vlaanderen, 9000, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"More of the Belfry's timber-and-iron interior framework on the way up, followed by a street-level surprise back in Ghent — a grand historic building now occupied by a McDonald's amid the bustle of bicycles and pedestrians.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-09/20260709_144503.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_144511.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_161722.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-09","cluster_idx":7,"centroid_lat":51.052987,"centroid_lon":3.727478,"time_start":"2026-07-09T15:07:30.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-09T16:05:01.000Z","location_label":"Sint-Baafskathedraal, Gent","place_full":"Sint-Baafskathedraal, 1A, Sint-Baafsplein, Portus aan de Reep, Gent, Oost-Vlaanderen, Vlaanderen, 9000, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"An extensive visit inside Saint Bavo's Cathedral in Ghent, taking in its Baroque pulpit and pipe organ, Rubens's painting of Saint Bavo's entry into the monastery, the marble tombs and high altar, and the famed Ghent Altarpiece by Jan van Eyck with its Mystic Lamb centerpiece, alongside an unexpected curiosity of whale bones hanging in a side chapel.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-09/20260709_150731.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_151316.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_151352.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_151415.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_151424.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_151524.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_151530.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_153007.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_153049.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_153058.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_153331.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_153935.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_153953.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_154019.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_154106.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_154127.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_154157.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_154208.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_154226.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_154229.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_154355.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_155825.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_160009.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_160028.jpg","photos/2026-07-09/20260709_160501.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-10","cluster_idx":0,"centroid_lat":51.206499,"centroid_lon":3.22293,"time_start":"2026-07-10T13:43:20.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-10T13:43:20.000Z","location_label":"Simon Stevinplein, Brugge","place_full":"Simon Stevinplein, Steenstraatkwartier, Brugge-Centrum, Brugge, West-Vlaanderen, Vlaanderen, 8000, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"Bruges's Markt square at midday, the Belfry tower rising behind the neo-Gothic Provincial Court building with horse-drawn carriages and cafe umbrellas filling the lively square below.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-10/20260710_134320.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-10","cluster_idx":1,"centroid_lat":51.207798,"centroid_lon":3.225135,"time_start":"2026-07-10T14:49:35.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-10T14:49:35.000Z","location_label":"Hallen, Brugge","place_full":"Hallen, Steenstraatkwartier, Brugge-Centrum, Brugge, West-Vlaanderen, Vlaanderen, 8000, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"A view across Bruges's Markt square framed by cafe tables, with the Belfry and the ornate Provincial Court presiding over the steady flow of tourists and horse-drawn carriages.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-10/20260710_144935.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-10","cluster_idx":2,"centroid_lat":51.208809,"centroid_lon":3.224362,"time_start":"2026-07-10T14:55:32.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-10T22:48:42.000Z","location_label":"Markt, Brugge","place_full":"1, Markt, Steenstraatkwartier, Brugge-Centrum, Brugge, West-Vlaanderen, Vlaanderen, 8000, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"An afternoon-into-evening stretch in and around Bruges's Markt square: gazing up the Belfry's Gothic tiers and its carved heraldic medallions, a burst of selfies with the couple posed against the Provincial Court, then the same buildings glowing at dusk over a crowded square before the group ends up outside the restaurant De Carre after dark.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-10/20260710_145532.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_145729.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_145730.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_145732_001.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_145738.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_145828.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_145841.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_145843.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_224822.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_224841.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-10","cluster_idx":3,"centroid_lat":51.210837,"centroid_lon":3.224425,"time_start":"2026-07-10T15:08:56.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-10T15:12:56.000Z","location_label":"Kraanplein, Brugge","place_full":"Kraanplein, Sint-Walburgakwartier, Brugge-Centrum, Brugge, West-Vlaanderen, Vlaanderen, 8000, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"Wandering the lanes just off Bruges's Markt square, past cafe tables and shopfronts toward the Belfry, and a Gothic-windowed building with bicycles leaned against its wall and a bar sign overhead.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-10/20260710_150856.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_151256.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-10","cluster_idx":4,"centroid_lat":51.211585,"centroid_lon":3.226016,"time_start":"2026-07-10T15:22:00.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-10T15:24:42.000Z","location_label":"Jan van Eyckplein, Brugge","place_full":"9, Jan van Eyckplein, Sint-Walburgakwartier, Brugge-Centrum, Brugge, West-Vlaanderen, Vlaanderen, 8000, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"Strolling a classic Bruges canal, with colorful gabled townhouses reflected along the water, a tour boat passing under a stone bridge, and a stop at the stepped-gable Black Bird Coffee Club for its outdoor cafe seating.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-10/20260710_152200.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_152346.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_152436.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_152442 copy.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_152442.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-10","cluster_idx":5,"centroid_lat":51.212155,"centroid_lon":3.227542,"time_start":"2026-07-10T15:27:21.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-10T15:28:06.000Z","location_label":"Spiegelrei, Brugge","place_full":"8, Spiegelrei, Sint-Walburgakwartier, Brugge-Centrum, Brugge, West-Vlaanderen, Vlaanderen, 8000, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"More canal scenery in Bruges -- a stone bridge with a tour boat gliding beneath gabled townhouses in white, ochre, and red -- leading to a cobblestone waterside street with the Belfry in the distance and finally the towering brick spire of the Church of Our Lady rising above a small fountain plaza.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-10/20260710_152721 copy.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_152721.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_152758.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_152806.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-10","cluster_idx":6,"centroid_lat":51.21094,"centroid_lon":3.228129,"time_start":"2026-07-10T15:38:49.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-10T15:38:49.000Z","location_label":"Engelsestraat, Brugge","place_full":"2, Engelsestraat, Sint-Walburgakwartier, Brugge-Centrum, Brugge, West-Vlaanderen, Vlaanderen, 8000, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"A red-brick, stepped-gable Flemish townhouse in Bruges's old town, its leaded windows tinged green with reflected foliage and a small plaque marking its 1930 restoration.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-10/20260710_153849.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-10","cluster_idx":7,"centroid_lat":51.20821,"centroid_lon":3.226766,"time_start":"2026-07-10T16:10:17.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-10T16:10:17.000Z","location_label":"Burg, Brugge","place_full":"13, Burg, Sint-Walburgakwartier, Brugge-Centrum, Brugge, West-Vlaanderen, Vlaanderen, 8000, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"Inside Bruges's Jeruzalemkerk, a 15th-century chapel built by the Adornes family to evoke the Holy Sepulchre, with its apse fresco pairing the Heavenly Jerusalem and Bethlehem behind a gilded, skull-and-ladder altar modeled on Golgotha beneath a stained-glass rose window.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-10/20260710_161017.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-10","cluster_idx":8,"centroid_lat":51.204604,"centroid_lon":3.224561,"time_start":"2026-07-10T16:36:11.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-10T23:27:49.000Z","location_label":"Madonna met Kind, Brugge","place_full":"Madonna met Kind, Onze-Lieve-Vrouwekerkhof-Zuid, Onze-Lieve-Vrouwekwartier, Brugge-Centrum, Brugge, West-Vlaanderen, Vlaanderen, 8000, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"An extensive tour through a Bruges church's art and treasury -- ranging from a modern portrait installation, bronze Stations of the Cross, and Baroque carvings and altarpieces to medieval wall paintings, gilded reliquary busts, and relic fragments -- centered on Michelangelo's Madonna of Bruges and a monumental Crucifixion triptych, with the day closing on a quiet, dark canal glowing under a lit hotel sign.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-10/20260710_163612.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_163648.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_163738.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_164244.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_164321.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_164530.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_164607.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_164621.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_164629.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_164724.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_164737.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_164805.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_164817.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_164841.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_164959.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_165037.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_165146.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_165313-EDIT.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_165403.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_165428.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_165509.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_165547.jpg","photos/2026-07-10/20260710_232747.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-11","cluster_idx":0,"centroid_lat":51.278266,"centroid_lon":3.030186,"time_start":"2026-07-11T11:23:17.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-11T11:23:17.000Z","location_label":"Kerlinga, De Haan","place_full":"Kerlinga, 21, Zeedijk-De Haan, Concessiewijk, De Haan, Klemskerke, De Haan, Oostende, West-Vlaanderen, Vlaanderen, 8420, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"De Haan's belle-epoque beach promenade, with striped beach cabins, sun umbrellas, and a wide sandy shore stretching along the North Sea.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-11/20260711_112316.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-11","cluster_idx":1,"centroid_lat":51.277772,"centroid_lon":3.028931,"time_start":"2026-07-11T11:47:04.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-11T11:47:04.000Z","location_label":"Paname, De Haan","place_full":"Paname, 13, Zeedijk-De Haan, Concessiewijk, De Haan, Klemskerke, De Haan, Oostende, West-Vlaanderen, Vlaanderen, 8420, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"A sunny moment on De Haan's beach promenade, a woman in a sun hat perched on the railing with a paper cone of Belgian fries as swimmers and a play structure fill the beach behind her.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-11/20260711_114703.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-11","cluster_idx":2,"centroid_lat":51.278927,"centroid_lon":3.028387,"time_start":"2026-07-11T12:06:37.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-11T12:09:50.000Z","location_label":"Zeedijk-De Haan, De Haan","place_full":"Speelplein Strand De Haan - Centrum, Zeedijk-De Haan, Concessiewijk, De Haan, Klemskerke, De Haan, Oostende, West-Vlaanderen, Vlaanderen, 8420, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"Splashing in the North Sea at De Haan, with wading and swimming shots against the town's dune-backed, belle-epoque skyline and a distant sailboat, plus wide panoramic views of sunbathers scattered along the sand.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-11/20260711_120637.jpg","photos/2026-07-11/20260711_120652.jpg","photos/2026-07-11/20260711_120706.jpg","photos/2026-07-11/20260711_120950.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-11","cluster_idx":3,"centroid_lat":51.281183,"centroid_lon":3.036502,"time_start":"2026-07-11T12:52:26.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-11T12:52:36.000Z","location_label":"Villa Zilverschoon, De Haan","place_full":"Villa Zilverschoon, 46, Zeedijk-De Haan, Concessiewijk, De Haan, Klemskerke, De Haan, Oostende, West-Vlaanderen, Vlaanderen, 8421, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"'Eternity,' a bronze Poseidon-like statue lined with perched bronze pigeons, standing on De Haan's beachfront promenade as part of the Beaufort coastal art trail, sea and kitesurfers behind it.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-11/20260711_125226.jpg","photos/2026-07-11/20260711_125236.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-12","cluster_idx":0,"centroid_lat":52.373041,"centroid_lon":4.883045,"time_start":"2026-07-12T18:05:32.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-12T18:05:32.000Z","location_label":"Prinsengracht, Amsterdam","place_full":"311A, Prinsengracht, De 9 Straatjes, Grachtengordel, Centrum, Amsterdam, Noord-Holland, Nederland, 1016 GX, Nederland","country":"Nederland","overview-description":"The Westertoren's brick clock tower, capped with Amsterdam's blue-and-gold Imperial Crown, rising above canal-side trees and rowhouses as seen from a boat on the Prinsengracht.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-12/20260712_180532.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-12","cluster_idx":1,"centroid_lat":52.371471,"centroid_lon":4.913448,"time_start":"2026-07-12T18:57:40.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-12T18:57:40.000Z","location_label":"Prins Hendrikkade, Amsterdam","place_full":"602, Prins Hendrikkade, Kadijken, Centrum, Amsterdam, Noord-Holland, Nederland, 1011 VX, Nederland","country":"Nederland","overview-description":"NEMO Science Museum's angular, ship-hull-shaped green building seen across Amsterdam's harbour, with tall-masted sailing barges and a small passenger boat crossing in front.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-12/20260712_185740.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-14","cluster_idx":0,"centroid_lat":50.774648,"centroid_lon":6.084734,"time_start":"2026-07-14T15:53:18.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-14T16:21:54.000Z","location_label":"Ursulinerstraße, Aachen","place_full":"Photo Preim, 3-5, Ursulinerstraße, Burtscheid, Aachen-Mitte, Aachen, Städteregion Aachen, Nordrhein-Westfalen, 52062, Deutschland","country":"Deutschland","overview-description":"A day exploring Aachen's Altstadt, starting with the group posing around a bronze figurative fountain sculpture in a red-brick plaza and moving on to Aachen Cathedral, where the towering Gothic choir hall's stained glass and the golden Barbarossa Chandelier -- with its Latin dedication -- are the highlights.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-14/20260714_155318.jpg","photos/2026-07-14/20260714_155324.jpg","photos/2026-07-14/20260714_155351.jpg","photos/2026-07-14/20260714_155502.jpg","photos/2026-07-14/20260714_155642.jpg","photos/2026-07-14/20260714_162038.jpg","photos/2026-07-14/20260714_162123.jpg","photos/2026-07-14/20260714_162154.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-14","cluster_idx":1,"centroid_lat":50.74114,"centroid_lon":6.241744,"time_start":"2026-07-14T18:20:14.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-14T18:20:14.000Z","location_label":"Rüst, Stolberg","place_full":"Rasenplatz Breinigerberg, Rüst, Breinigerberg, Vicht, Stolberg, Städteregion Aachen, Nordrhein-Westfalen, 52223, Deutschland","country":"Deutschland","overview-description":"A glass-walled padel court at TC Blau-Weiss Stolberg, seen from outside in the evening after a day of Aachen sightseeing.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-14/20260714_182015.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-15","cluster_idx":0,"centroid_lat":50.846432,"centroid_lon":4.352431,"time_start":"2026-07-15T18:48:07.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-15T18:50:02.000Z","location_label":"Grand-Place - Grote Markt, Bruxelles - Brussel","place_full":"9, Grand-Place - Grote Markt, Quartier du Centre - Centrumwijk, Pentagone - Vijfhoek, Bruxelles - Brussel, Brussel-Hoofdstad - Bruxelles-Capitale, Région de Bruxelles-Capitale - Brussels Hoofdstedelijk Gewest, 1000, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"Ornamental details on Brussels's Grand-Place guild houses, from a gilded equestrian statue crowning a pediment to a bronze relief of an armored knight on a rearing horse flanked by coats of arms.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-15/20260715_184807.jpg","photos/2026-07-15/20260715_185002.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-15","cluster_idx":1,"centroid_lat":50.843419,"centroid_lon":4.357814,"time_start":"2026-07-15T20:45:47.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-15T20:50:44.000Z","location_label":"Petite rue du Musée - Korte Museumstraat, Bruxelles - Brussel","place_full":"Petite rue du Musée - Korte Museumstraat, Quartier Royal - Koninklijke Wijk, Pentagone - Vijfhoek, Bruxelles - Brussel, Brussel-Hoofdstad - Bruxelles-Capitale, Région de Bruxelles-Capitale - Brussels Hoofdstedelijk Gewest, 1000, België / Belgique / Belgien","country":"België / Belgique / Belgien","overview-description":"Sunset on Brussels's Mont des Arts, with symmetrical gardens and fountains framing views toward the Town Hall spire, a street musician playing guitar, a whimsical street art mural nearby, and an ornate astronomical clock above the Palais des Congres archway.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-15/20260715_204547.jpg","photos/2026-07-15/20260715_204657.jpg","photos/2026-07-15/20260715_204709.jpg","photos/2026-07-15/20260715_204718.jpg","photos/2026-07-15/20260715_205044.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-17","cluster_idx":0,"centroid_lat":50.552839,"centroid_lon":6.236598,"time_start":"2026-07-17T12:28:13.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-17T12:28:13.000Z","location_label":"Erlebnismuseum Lernort Natur, Monschau","place_full":"Erlebnismuseum Lernort Natur, 15, Burgau, Heidgen, Höfen, Monschau, Städteregion Aachen, Nordrhein-Westfalen, 52156, Deutschland","country":"Deutschland","overview-description":"Two members of the travel group inspecting a numbered marker beside a large sand-sculpture relief of robed figures at Monschau's roped-off sand-sculpture exhibit.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-17/20260717_122813.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-17","cluster_idx":1,"centroid_lat":50.555072,"centroid_lon":6.240939,"time_start":"2026-07-17T13:22:53.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-17T13:38:31.000Z","location_label":"Laufenstraße, Monschau","place_full":"Laufenstraße, Mützenich, Imgenbroich, Monschau, Städteregion Aachen, Nordrhein-Westfalen, 52156, Deutschland","country":"Deutschland","overview-description":"A hillside overlook of Monschau's half-timbered Altstadt, taking in the church's clock tower and onion-domed spire, the ruined towers of Monschau Castle, and the Rur curling past rooftops below, along with a visit to the salmon-pink Rotes Haus mansion where the group posed by its gilded 'Zum goldenen Helm' entrance crest.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-17/20260717_132253.jpg","photos/2026-07-17/20260717_132459.jpg","photos/2026-07-17/20260717_132842.jpg","photos/2026-07-17/20260717_132927.jpg","photos/2026-07-17/20260717_132936.jpg","photos/2026-07-17/20260717_133004.jpg","photos/2026-07-17/20260717_133014.jpg","photos/2026-07-17/20260717_133600.jpg","photos/2026-07-17/20260717_133610.jpg","photos/2026-07-17/20260717_133635.jpg","photos/2026-07-17/20260717_133830.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-17","cluster_idx":2,"centroid_lat":50.556062,"centroid_lon":6.24129,"time_start":"2026-07-17T13:41:23.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-17T13:44:23.000Z","location_label":"Panoramaweg, Monschau","place_full":"Haller, Panoramaweg, Mützenich, Imgenbroich, Monschau, Städteregion Aachen, Nordrhein-Westfalen, 52156, Deutschland","country":"Deutschland","overview-description":"Views of Monschau from above and up close, taking in a half-timbered house on the outskirts, a sweeping hillside panorama of the church spire and stone bridge over the Rur amid the town's grey-roofed valley, and a detail shot of the weathered castle tower keeping watch over it all.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-17/20260717_134122.jpg","photos/2026-07-17/20260717_134249.jpg","photos/2026-07-17/20260717_134423.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-19","cluster_idx":0,"centroid_lat":50.723149,"centroid_lon":6.089558,"time_start":"2026-07-19T13:35:57.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-19T13:35:57.000Z","location_label":"KuKuK e.V. - Kunst und Kultur im Köpfchen (ehemaliges deutsches Zollhaus), Aachen","place_full":"KuKuK e.V. - Kunst und Kultur im Köpfchen (ehemaliges deutsches Zollhaus), 420, Eupener Straße, Köpfchen, Aachen-Mitte, Aachen, Städteregion Aachen, Nordrhein-Westfalen, 52076, Deutschland","country":"Deutschland","overview-description":"A whimsical scrap-metal deer sculpture welded onto a living tree along the Vennbahn cycle path, a playful roadside surprise in a forest clearing.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-19/20260719_133557.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-20","cluster_idx":0,"centroid_lat":54.792383,"centroid_lon":9.433869,"time_start":"2026-07-20T20:30:27.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-20T20:30:27.000Z","location_label":"Schiffbrücke, Flensburg","place_full":"Schiffbrücke, Nordertor, Altstadt, Flensburg, Schleswig-Holstein, 24939, Deutschland","country":"Deutschland","overview-description":"Flensburg's inner harbour at dusk, with sailboats reflected in calm pink-tinted water and St. Nikolai's neo-Gothic spire rising over the rooftops.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-20/20260720_203027.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-20","cluster_idx":1,"centroid_lat":54.795669,"centroid_lon":9.431334,"time_start":"2026-07-20T20:39:27.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-20T20:39:27.000Z","location_label":"Am Nordertor, Flensburg","place_full":"Am Nordertor, Nordertor, Altstadt, Flensburg, Schleswig-Holstein, 24939, Deutschland","country":"Deutschland","overview-description":"The Flensburg harbour promenade in evening light, where a stepped stone fountain leads down to the water past the striking blue-tiled Phänomenta museum.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-20/20260720_203927.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-21","cluster_idx":0,"centroid_lat":54.792468,"centroid_lon":9.433508,"time_start":"2026-07-21T11:12:35.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-21T19:20:09.000Z","location_label":"Schiffbrücke, Flensburg","place_full":"32, Schiffbrücke, Nordertor, Altstadt, Flensburg, Schleswig-Holstein, 24939, Deutschland","country":"Deutschland","overview-description":"A stay at the Hotel Hafen Flensburg, from a quirky shoe-shine machine in the corridor to the hotel's own weathered steel facade standing out among the old town's mixed historic buildings, capped by an evening harbor view of sailboats from the room window.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-21/20260721_111235.jpg","photos/2026-07-21/20260721_152514.jpg","photos/2026-07-21/20260721_152559.jpg","photos/2026-07-21/20260721_192009.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-21","cluster_idx":1,"centroid_lat":54.788128,"centroid_lon":9.432278,"time_start":"2026-07-21T11:33:43.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-21T11:33:43.000Z","location_label":"Große Straße, Flensburg","place_full":"53-55, Große Straße, Altstadt, St. Marien, Altstadt, Flensburg, Schleswig-Holstein, 24937, Deutschland","country":"Deutschland","overview-description":"A playful sign outside a Flensburg boutique specializing in colorful dog leashes and accessories.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-21/20260721_113343.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-21","cluster_idx":2,"centroid_lat":54.782697,"centroid_lon":9.436251,"time_start":"2026-07-21T12:15:56.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-21T12:17:06.000Z","location_label":"Holm, Flensburg","place_full":"Timmermann, 63, Holm, St. Nikolai, Altstadt, Flensburg, Schleswig-Holstein, 24937, Deutschland","country":"Deutschland","overview-description":"Two landmarks of Flensburg's old town: St. Nikolai's turreted spire rising above the rooftops and the 1436 stepped-gable Nikolai-Apotheke pharmacy, with a nightclub tucked in its cellar.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-21/20260721_121556.jpg","photos/2026-07-21/20260721_121706.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-21","cluster_idx":3,"centroid_lat":54.781435,"centroid_lon":9.435185,"time_start":"2026-07-21T12:42:30.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-21T12:42:30.000Z","location_label":"Die Weinstube im Krusehof, Flensburg","place_full":"Die Weinstube im Krusehof, 24, Rote Straße, St. Nikolai, Altstadt, Flensburg, Schleswig-Holstein, 24937, Deutschland","country":"Deutschland","overview-description":"A visit to a historic Flensburg rum and wine cellar, posing with an antique bottle of Pommerlunder herbal liqueur among the wooden barrels.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-21/20260721_124230.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-21","cluster_idx":4,"centroid_lat":54.784666,"centroid_lon":9.433377,"time_start":"2026-07-21T12:59:17.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-21T13:04:26.000Z","location_label":"Südergraben, Flensburg","place_full":"31, Südergraben, St. Nikolai, Altstadt, Flensburg, Schleswig-Holstein, 24937, Deutschland","country":"Deutschland","overview-description":"An Art Nouveau apartment facade from 1904 with ornate stucco reliefs, followed by a stop among weathered stone columns in the wooded grounds of the Museumsberg park.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-21/20260721_125917.jpg","photos/2026-07-21/20260721_130426.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-21","cluster_idx":5,"centroid_lat":54.785598,"centroid_lon":9.431784,"time_start":"2026-07-21T13:08:40.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-21T13:56:54.000Z","location_label":"Flensburg","place_full":"Museumsberg, Friesischer Berg, Flensburg, Schleswig-Holstein, 24937, Deutschland","country":"Deutschland","overview-description":"An extensive visit to the Museumsberg in Flensburg, moving from outdoor stonework -- a sundial, carved grave slabs, cherub and heraldic reliefs, and the inscribed entrance porch -- into the museum's varied indoor collections, including a costumed 18th-century figure, a reconstructed schoolroom, a moralizing 1591 painting, a shark jaw paired with a Gothic altarpiece, and treasury pieces like a silver drinking horn, a gilded reliquary casket, and a jeweled crown.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-21/20260721_130840.jpg","photos/2026-07-21/20260721_130907.jpg","photos/2026-07-21/20260721_130919.jpg","photos/2026-07-21/20260721_131001.jpg","photos/2026-07-21/20260721_131210.jpg","photos/2026-07-21/20260721_131215.jpg","photos/2026-07-21/20260721_131857.jpg","photos/2026-07-21/20260721_133624.jpg","photos/2026-07-21/20260721_134702.jpg","photos/2026-07-21/20260721_135156.jpg","photos/2026-07-21/20260721_135438.jpg","photos/2026-07-21/20260721_135558.jpg","photos/2026-07-21/20260721_135654.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-21","cluster_idx":6,"centroid_lat":54.793586,"centroid_lon":9.433985,"time_start":"2026-07-21T16:09:48.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-21T16:09:48.000Z","location_label":"Bens Fischhütte, Flensburg","place_full":"Bens Fischhütte, Schiffbrücke, Nordertor, Altstadt, Flensburg, Schleswig-Holstein, 24939, Deutschland","country":"Deutschland","overview-description":"Relaxing on the Flensburg harbor dock with a Flensburger beer and bratwurst, sailboats and waterfront apartments across the water.","multimedia_files"