n, Torekov","place_full":"Flymossavägen, Lugnet, Torekov, Båstads kommun, Skåne län, 269 77, Sverige","country":"Sverige","overview-description":"A walk along the rocky Bjarekusten coast north of Torekov, passing a campground and breakwaters, open sea views with distant sailboats, tide pools dotted with orange lichen and small wildflowers, and a wooden footbridge leading toward Torekov's colorful harbourfront.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-26/20260726_102858.jpg","photos/2026-07-26/20260726_102941.jpg","photos/2026-07-26/20260726_103153.jpg","photos/2026-07-26/20260726_103202.jpg","photos/2026-07-26/20260726_103212.jpg","photos/2026-07-26/20260726_103407.jpg","photos/2026-07-26/20260726_103653.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-26","cluster_idx":1,"centroid_lat":56.439303,"centroid_lon":12.63818,"time_start":"2026-07-26T10:50:21.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-26T10:51:26.000Z","location_label":"Källrevägen, Torekov","place_full":"Källrevägen, Perstorp, Torekov, Båstads kommun, Skåne län, 269 78, Sverige","country":"Sverige","overview-description":"A coastal pasture above the Bjara shore where sheep -- including a black-faced, blue-eartagged lamb -- graze and rest near the water, with a flock of Canada geese also spotted along the same rocky shoreline.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-26/20260726_105021.jpg","photos/2026-07-26/20260726_105036.jpg","photos/2026-07-26/20260726_105046.jpg","photos/2026-07-26/20260726_105126.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-26","cluster_idx":2,"centroid_lat":56.392913,"centroid_lon":12.637433,"time_start":"2026-07-26T12:34:18.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-26T12:35:27.000Z","location_label":"Klavaslättsvägen, Båstads kommun","place_full":"Klavaslättsvägen, Faritslöv, Båstads kommun, Skåne län, 269 78, Sverige","country":"Sverige","overview-description":"A farm scene south of Torekov: a car paused at a wooden gate between dry-stone walls near a cottage, and cattle grazing along a rocky shoreline beneath a hawk circling overhead.","multimed