tone appears alongside a scenic forest lake dotted with a small wooded islet under a sky of tall cumulus clouds.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-27/20260727_131315.jpg","photos/2026-07-27/20260727_131356.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-28","cluster_idx":0,"centroid_lat":56.300695,"centroid_lon":12.469862,"time_start":"2026-07-28T13:09:47.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-28T13:35:08.000Z","location_label":"Italienska vägen, Mölle","place_full":"Mölle Golfklubb, Italienska vägen, Hjorthagen, Mölle, Höganäs kommun, Skåne län, 263 77, Sverige","country":"Sverige","overview-description":"A dramatic stretch of the Kullaberg peninsula's coast near Molle, where a red cottage tucked among gardens gives way to rugged, wave-battered cliffs, pebble beaches, and rocky headlands, with fishermen casting from the rocks and people pausing to take in the crashing surf.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-28/20260728_130947.jpg","photos/2026-07-28/20260728_130955.jpg","photos/2026-07-28/20260728_131358.jpg","photos/2026-07-28/20260728_131431.jpg","photos/2026-07-28/20260728_131849.jpg","photos/2026-07-28/20260728_131916.jpg","photos/2026-07-28/20260728_132030.jpg","photos/2026-07-28/20260728_132055.jpg","photos/2026-07-28/20260728_132330.jpg","photos/2026-07-28/20260728_133508.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-28","cluster_idx":1,"centroid_lat":56.299771,"centroid_lon":12.476955,"time_start":"2026-07-28T13:57:47.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-28T13:57:47.000Z","location_label":"Italienska vägen, Mölle","place_full":"Italienska vägen, Aldal, Mölle, Höganäs kommun, Skåne län, 263 77, Sverige","country":"Sverige","overview-description":"A hazy view across the sea from the Kullaberg peninsula toward a distant coastal town and hills on the horizon.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-28/20260728_135747.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-28","cluster_idx":2,"centroid_lat":56.299726,"centroid_lon":12.479448,"time_start":"2026-07-28T14:02:38.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-28T14:02:38.000Z","location_label":"Italienska vägen, Mölle","place_full":"Italienska vägen, Aldal, Mölle, Höganäs kommun, Skåne län, 263 77, Sverige","country":"Sverige","overview-description":"A beech forest trail on the Kullaberg peninsula overlooking the rocky coast, with a hiker visible exploring the shoreline below.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-28/20260728_140237.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-28","cluster_idx":3,"centroid_lat":56.299095,"centroid_lon":12.48242,"time_start":"2026-07-28T14:05:56.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-28T14:11:54.000Z","location_label":"Josefinelust, Mölle","place_full":"Josefinelust, Italienska vägen, Aldal, Mölle, Höganäs kommun, Skåne län, 263 77, Sverige","country":"Sverige","overview-description":"Along the Kullaberg peninsula's Josefinelust overlook, hikers rest atop a dramatic cliff-edge outcrop above a turquoise sea, near a trilingual safety sign and the Kullaleden trail map that charts the route around the peninsula.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-28/20260728_140556.jpg","photos/2026-07-28/20260728_140803.jpg","photos/2026-07-28/20260728_140906.jpg","photos/2026-07-28/20260728_141154.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-28","cluster_idx":4,"centroid_lat":56.294428,"centroid_lon":12.480038,"time_start":"2026-07-28T14:24:20.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-28T14:26:47.000Z","location_label":"Italienska vägen, Mölle","place_full":"Kullamannens grav, Italienska vägen, Aldal, Mölle, Höganäs kommun, Skåne län, 263 77, Sverige","country":"Sverige","overview-description":"A signposted trail toward Kullamannens Grav leads through sunlit oak woodland on the Kullaberg peninsula, marked with blue trail tape along a grassy uphill path.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-28/20260728_142420.jpg","photos/2026-07-28/20260728_142625.jpg","photos/2026-07-28/20260728_142647.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-28","cluster_idx":5,"centroid_lat":56.293388,"centroid_lon":12.481627,"time_start":"2026-07-28T14:29:27.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-28T14:29:27.000Z","location_label":"Italienska vägen, Mölle","place_full":"Kullamannens grav, Italienska vägen, Aldal, Mölle, Höganäs kommun, Skåne län, 263 77, Sverige","country":"Sverige","overview-description":"A wide, gnarled oak arches over the Kullaberg trail, its branches casting dappled shade across the path.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-28/20260728_142927.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-28","cluster_idx":6,"centroid_lat":56.291468,"centroid_lon":12.475258,"time_start":"2026-07-28T14:55:04.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-28T15:03:05.000Z","location_label":"Italienska vägen, Mölle","place_full":"Italienska vägen, Aldal, Mölle, Höganäs kommun, Skåne län, 263 77, Sverige","country":"Sverige","overview-description":"A coastal walk near Molle passes the hydrangea-lined steps to the Ramsvik Havsveranda seaside restaurant and its flag-topped terrace, then continues along a grassy trail past a picnic bench and old stone ruins with sweeping views of the sea, a distant ship, and the village and bay framed by crashing waves on the rocky Kullaberg shore.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-28/20260728_145503.jpg","photos/2026-07-28/20260728_145530.jpg","photos/2026-07-28/20260728_145953.jpg","photos/2026-07-28/20260728_150033.jpg","photos/2026-07-28/20260728_150146.jpg","photos/2026-07-28/20260728_150201.jpg","photos/2026-07-28/20260728_150235.jpg","photos/2026-07-28/20260728_150305.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-28","cluster_idx":7,"centroid_lat":56.292076,"centroid_lon":12.473104,"time_start":"2026-07-28T15:19:44.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-28T15:20:13.000Z","location_label":"Italienska vägen, Mölle","place_full":"Italienska vägen, Aldal, Mölle, Höganäs kommun, Skåne län, 263 77, Sverige","country":"Sverige","overview-description":"A panoramic overlook of Molle's church spire, rooftops, and harbor curving along the shoreline, with a distant ship crossing the hazy sea beyond the peninsula.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-28/20260728_151944.jpg","photos/2026-07-28/20260728_152013.jpg"]},{"folder":"photo