swept summit of the Kullaberg peninsula, marked by a maritime radar tower rising above juniper-covered hillside and a nearby telecommunications tower.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-28/20260728_155136.jpg","photos/2026-07-28/20260728_155222.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-28","cluster_idx":12,"centroid_lat":56.297354,"centroid_lon":12.460961,"time_start":"2026-07-28T15:55:17.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-28T15:57:11.000Z","location_label":"Italienska vägen, Mölle","place_full":"Italienska vägen, Mölle, Höganäs kommun, Skåne län, 263 77, Sverige","country":"Sverige","overview-description":"Near the tip of the Kullaberg peninsula, visitors walk the cliff path toward the Kullen Lighthouse and its red-roofed keeper's building, while elsewhere on the exposed hilltop wind-bent birch trees frame the view.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-28/20260728_155517.jpg","photos/2026-07-28/20260728_155710.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-28","cluster_idx":13,"centroid_lat":56.297371,"centroid_lon":12.45757,"time_start":"2026-07-28T16:01:34.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-28T16:01:34.000Z","location_label":"Italienska vägen, Höganäs kommun","place_full":"Italienska vägen, Höganäs kommun, Skåne län, 263 77, Sverige","country":"Sverige","overview-description":"The sea and hazy distant coastline framed by an oak tree at the tip of the Kullaberg peninsula.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-28/20260728_160134.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-07-28","cluster_idx":14,"centroid_lat":56.298153,"centroid_lon":12.45496,"time_start":"2026-07-28T16:04:49.000Z","time_end":"2026-07-28T16:07:11.000Z","location_label":"Italienska vägen, Höganäs kommun","place_full":"Italienska vägen, Höganäs kommun, Skåne län, 263 77, Sverige","country":"Sverige","overview-description":"Visitors approach and gather around the Kullen Lighthouse on its rocky headland at the tip of the Kullaberg peninsula, with a close view of its lantern room atop the tower.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-07-28/20260728_160449.jpg"