ut on the grass.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-08-02/20260802_122855.jpg","photos/2026-08-02/20260802_123050.jpg","photos/2026-08-02/20260802_150359.jpg","photos/2026-08-02/20260802_150506.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-08-02","cluster_idx":3,"centroid_lat":57.106779,"centroid_lon":12.239526,"time_start":"2026-08-02T12:33:18.000Z","time_end":"2026-08-02T15:07:53.000Z","location_label":"Varbergs Strandpromenad, Varberg","place_full":"10, Varbergs Strandpromenad, Brunnsberg, Varberg, Varbergs kommun, Hallands län, 432 44, Sverige","country":"Sverige","overview-description":"An extensive tour of Varberg Fortress and its coastline -- historic buildings dated to 1650, an archive and museum housing the medieval Bocksten Man bog body, cannon-lined ramparts overlooking the sea, and a coastal walk past red-housed skerries, sailboats, and a cast-iron historical marker.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-08-02/20260802_123318.jpg","photos/2026-08-02/20260802_123326.jpg","photos/2026-08-02/20260802_123404.jpg","photos/2026-08-02/20260802_123541.jpg","photos/2026-08-02/20260802_123605.jpg","photos/2026-08-02/20260802_123720.jpg","photos/2026-08-02/20260802_123819.jpg","photos/2026-08-02/20260802_123934.jpg","photos/2026-08-02/20260802_130639.jpg","photos/2026-08-02/20260802_150621.jpg","photos/2026-08-02/20260802_150627.jpg","photos/2026-08-02/20260802_150636.jpg","photos/2026-08-02/20260802_150733.jpg","photos/2026-08-02/20260802_150738.jpg","photos/2026-08-02/20260802_150753.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-08-02","cluster_idx":4,"centroid_lat":57.10516,"centroid_lon":12.240585,"time_start":"2026-08-02T14:29:47.000Z","time_end":"2026-08-02T14:29:55.000Z","location_label":"Varbergs Strandpromenad, Varberg","place_full":"Varbergs Strandpromenad, Brunnsberg, Varberg, Varbergs kommun, Hallands län, 432 44, Sverige","country":"Sverige","overview-description":"Rows of chairs and stage equipment being set up for an outdoor event on Varberg Fortress's grassy, sea-view terrace.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-08-02/20260802_142947.jpg","photos/2026-08-02/20260802_142956.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-08-02","cluster_idx":5,"centroid_lat":57.105813,"centroid_lon":12.238858,"time_start":"2026-08-02T15:09:16.000Z","time_end":"2026-08-02T15:09:16.000Z","location_label":"Strandgatan, Varberg","place_full":"Varbergs Fästning, Strandgatan, Mariedal, Brunnsberg, Varberg, Varbergs kommun, Hallands län, 432 44, Sverige","country":"Sverige","overview-description":"A modern cafe built into Varberg Fortress's historic ramparts, its glass facade opening onto sweeping sea views.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-08-02/20260802_150916.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-08-02","cluster_idx":6,"centroid_lat":57.105274,"centroid_lon":12.250225,"time_start":"2026-08-02T16:17:55.000Z","time_end":"2026-08-02T16:18:24.000Z","location_label":"Stora torget, Varberg","place_full":"Stora torget, Mariedal, Brunnsberg, Varberg, Varbergs kommun, Hallands län, 432 41, Sverige","country":"Sverige","overview-description":"Central Varberg's landmarks, from the town church's clock tower overlooking the square to the grand brick tower of the Varbergs Stadshotell.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-08-02/20260802_161755.jpg","photos/2026-08-02/20260802_161824.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-08-02","cluster_idx":7,"centroid_lat":56.903838,"centroid_lon":12.491967,"time_start":"2026-08-02T17:23:29.000Z","time_end":"2026-08-02T17:23:34.000Z","location_label":"Torgatan, Falkenberg","place_full":"Torgatan, Skrea Strand, Falkenberg, Falkenbergs kommun, Hallands län, 311 21, Sverige","country":"Sverige","overview-description":"An evening view of the Varbergs Stadshotell's brick tower, followed by a lighthearted photo beside a giant penny-farthing bicycle sculpture on a cobblestone street.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-08-02/20260802_172329.jpg","photos/2026-08-02/20260802_172334.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-08-03","cluster_idx":0,"centroid_lat":56.041201,"centroid_lon":12.615857,"time_start":