"Sofierovägen, Laröd","place_full":"Sofierovägen, Norr, Laröd, Helsingborgs kommun, Skåne län, 252 86, Sverige","country":"Sverige","overview-description":"Crossing back into Sweden to Sofiero Palace, its turreted green roofs rising above manicured gardens threaded with gravel paths, a rose-covered arch, hedge 'windows' framing flower beds, and a tunnel of pink roses leading toward a stone fountain.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-08-03/20260803_162042.jpg","photos/2026-08-03/20260803_165705.jpg","photos/2026-08-03/20260803_165811.jpg","photos/2026-08-03/20260803_165850.jpg","photos/2026-08-03/20260803_171030.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-08-03","cluster_idx":5,"centroid_lat":56.084236,"centroid_lon":12.659512,"time_start":"2026-08-03T16:39:31.000Z","time_end":"2026-08-03T16:50:20.000Z","location_label":"Sofiero slott, Laröd","place_full":"Sofiero slott, 131, Sofierovägen, Norr, Laröd, Helsingborgs kommun, Skåne län, 252 84, Sverige","country":"Sverige","overview-description":"A stroll through Sofiero Castle's gardens, from the rhododendron ravine's shaded stone path down to a stream, to perennial borders bursting with purple and blue blooms framed by hedges and apple trees.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-08-03/20260803_163931.jpg","photos/2026-08-03/20260803_165020.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-08-03","cluster_idx":6,"centroid_lat":56.085386,"centroid_lon":12.660366,"time_start":"2026-08-03T16:54:53.000Z","time_end":"2026-08-03T16:56:06.000Z","location_label":"Gamla Larödsvägen, Laröd","place_full":"Gamla Larödsvägen, Norr, Laröd, Helsingborgs kommun, Skåne län, 252 86, Sverige","country":"Sverige","overview-description":"Playful portraits in the flower borders give way to quieter garden details at Sofiero — a rusted silhouette sculpture of a woman in period dress and a lily-pad-covered pond along the rhododendron paths.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-08-03/20260803_165453.jpg","photos/2026-08-03/20260803_165521.jpg","photos/2026-08-03/20260803_165530.jpg",