"multimedia_files":["photos/2026-08-08/20260808_103624.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-08-08","cluster_idx":1,"centroid_lat":56.105584,"centroid_lon":13.71479,"time_start":"2026-08-08T11:21:29.000Z","time_end":"2026-08-08T11:24:37.000Z","location_label":"Björnstigen, Tormestorp","place_full":"Björnstigen, Björkviken, Tormestorp, Hässleholms kommun, Skåne län, 281 46, Sverige","country":"Sverige","overview-description":"A closer look at Bäckaskog Castle, from its round tower and half-timbered barn to a whitewashed gable dated 1768, then inside to a period room furnished with old wooden pieces and out to a quiet courtyard within the grounds.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-08-08/20260808_112129.jpg","photos/2026-08-08/20260808_112211.jpg","photos/2026-08-08/20260808_112214.jpg","photos/2026-08-08/20260808_112327.jpg","photos/2026-08-08/20260808_112432.jpg","photos/2026-08-08/20260808_112437.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-08-08","cluster_idx":2,"centroid_lat":56.104866,"centroid_lon":13.712554,"time_start":"2026-08-08T11:28:27.000Z","time_end":"2026-08-08T11:45:34.000Z","location_label":"Björnstigen, Tormestorp","place_full":"Hovdala slott, Björnstigen, Björkviken, Tormestorp, Hässleholms kommun, Skåne län, 281 46, Sverige","country":"Sverige","overview-description":"A close look at a whitewashed castle's round tower and gatehouse, from the wrought-iron anchor plates on its facade to a heraldic tablet with carved lion heads and Latin inscriptions crowning the entrance archway, glimpsed from several angles around the courtyard.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-08-08/20260808_112827.jpg","photos/2026-08-08/20260808_112914.jpg","photos/2026-08-08/20260808_113221.jpg","photos/2026-08-08/20260808_113451.jpg","photos/2026-08-08/20260808_114534.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-08-08","cluster_idx":3,"centroid_lat":56.103672,"centroid_lon":13.713697,"time_start":"2026-08-08T11:51:59.000Z","time_end":"2026-08-08T11:57:56.000Z","location_label":"Tormestorp","place_full":"Tormestorp, Hässleholms kommun, Skåne län, 281 92, Sverige","country":"Sverige","overview-description":"Continuing through Bäckaskog's courtyard and outbuildings, the visit lingers on the castle's carved heraldic archway and its massive original iron-studded wooden door, alongside a whimsical folk-art gnome-and-goose sculpture and a playful pose at the old gateway.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-08-08/20260808_115159.jpg","photos/2026-08-08/20260808_115327.jpg","photos/2026-08-08/20260808_115554.jpg","photos/2026-08-08/20260808_115622.jpg","photos/2026-08-08/20260808_115634.jpg","photos/2026-08-08/20260808_115744.jpg","photos/2026-08-08/20260808_115753.jpg","photos/2026-08-08/20260808_115756.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-08-08","cluster_idx":4,"centroid_lat":56.114163,"centroid_lon":13.698009,"time_start":"2026-08-08T12:17:49.000Z","time_end":"2026-08-08T12:58:32.000Z","location_label":"Hundslingan, Hässleholms kommun","place_full":"Hundslingan, Hässleholms kommun, Skåne län, 281 92, Sverige","country":"Sverige","overview-description":"A wooden walkway through beech forest leads to a treetop restaurant on stilts overlooking a lake, where lunch (shrimp salad, lingonberry meatloaf, and Swedish cider) is enjoyed at a balcony table with sweeping views, followed by a hillside trail past a painted marker post with more lake and countryside vistas.","multimedia_files":["photos/2026-08-08/20260808_121749.jpg","photos/2026-08-08/20260808_121805.jpg","photos/2026-08-08/20260808_122214.jpg","photos/2026-08-08/20260808_122306.jpg","photos/2026-08-08/20260808_122307.jpg","photos/2026-08-08/20260808_122411.jpg","photos/2026-08-08/20260808_122952.jpg","photos/2026-08-08/20260808_125744.jpg","photos/2026-08-08/20260808_125815.jpg","photos/2026-08-08/20260808_125832.jpg"]},{"folder":"photos/2026-08-08","cluster_idx":5,"centroid_lat":56.113054,"centroid_lon":13.698879,"time_start":"2026-08-08T13:01:36.000Z","time_end":"2026-08-08T13:04:50.000Z","location_label":"Hundslingan, Hässleholms kom